{"type": "mcq", "stem": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The difference between the measure of angle <math alttext=\"upper A\"><mi>A</mi>\n</math> and the measure of angle <math alttext=\"upper B\"><mi>B</mi>\n</math> is <math alttext=\"negative five sixths pi\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mi>&#960;</mi></math> radians. Which expression shows the difference between the measure of angle <math alttext=\"upper A\"><mi>A</mi>\n</math> and the measure of angle <math alttext=\"upper B\"><mi>B</mi>\n</math>, in degrees?</p>", "keys": ["2b46ff67-9516-4e83-8a82-86332c35f4ba"], "answerOptions": [{"id": "e4c2a465-595e-4c41-8c89-5c743ed33584", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"negative five sixths pi dot StartFraction 360 degree Over pi EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>360</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></math></p>"}, {"id": "2b46ff67-9516-4e83-8a82-86332c35f4ba", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"negative five sixths pi dot StartFraction 180 degree Over pi EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></math></p>"}, {"id": "d78d6777-2d54-4c29-acef-a781f54fb801", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"negative five sixths pi dot StartFraction pi Over 180 degree EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"}, {"id": "dc378c16-e628-4b7f-b51c-3abfb28887c5", "content": "<p><math alttext=\"negative five sixths dot StartFraction 180 degree Over pi EndFraction\"><mrow>\n\t<mo>-</mo>\n\t<mfrac>\n\t\t<mn>5</mn>\n\t\t<mn>6</mn>\n\t</mfrac>\n</mrow>\n<mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></math></p>"}], "rationale": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice B&nbsp;is correct. Since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"pi\"><mi>&#960;</mi></math> radians <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"equals\"><mo>=</mo></math> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"180 degree\"><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>, the measure of an angle, in degrees, can be found by multiplying its measure, in radians, by <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"StartFraction 180 degree Over pi EndFraction\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac></math>. It&rsquo;s given that the difference between the measure of angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"upper A\"><mi>A</mi></math> and the measure of angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"upper B\"><mi>B</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"minus five sixths pi\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi></math> radians. It follows that the expression <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"minus five sixths pi dot StartFraction 180 degree Over pi EndFraction\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#960;</mo><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>180</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#960;</mo></mfrac></math> shows the difference between the measure of angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"upper A\"><mi>A</mi></math> and the measure of angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" alttext=\"upper B\"><mi>B</mi></math>, in degrees.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice A is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice C is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Choice D is incorrect and may result from conceptual or calculation errors.</p>", "externalid": "ab88ac2a-4efa-4ff6-86c0-5005fa88a598", "correct_answer": ["B"]}